## 7.1 Stock Adjustment

Allow the owner to:

- Increase stock.
- Decrease stock.
- Set an exact stock quantity.
- Record an adjustment reason.

Example reasons:

- New handmade batch.
- Damaged item.
- Manual correction.
- Returned item.
- Stock received.

