## 7.2 Inventory Rules

- Never allow negative stock.
- Prevent purchases exceeding available stock.
- Reserve or decrement inventory atomically during order processing.
- Restore inventory only through a controlled cancellation/refund workflow.
- Prevent duplicate stock deductions from repeated payment webhooks.
- Do not treat a failed or unverified payment as a completed sale.

